---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Home
permalink: /
---
{%- from "partials/macros.njk" import formArt %}
{%- set categories = products | map("category") | unique %}
{# SAMPLE CONTENT: hero text, testimonials and counters below are examples – replace them with your own. #}

<section class="hero-slider" aria-roledescription="carousel" aria-label="Highlights">
  <div class="slide is-active" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="1 of 2">
    <div class="container slide-content">
      <p class="slide-kicker">Welcome to {{ site.name }}</p>
      <h1>We Take Care Of<br>Your Healthy Life</h1>
      <p>{{ site.description }}</p>
      <a class="btn btn--accent btn--square" href="/products/">See All Products <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="slide slide--alt" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="2 of 2" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="container slide-content">
      <p class="slide-kicker">{{ site.tagline }}</p>
      <h1>Bringing Quality<br>Medicines to Life</h1>
      <p>Research, GMP manufacturing and strict quality control – for the whole family.</p>
      <a class="btn btn--accent btn--square" href="/about/" tabindex="-1">About Us <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="slider-dots" role="tablist" aria-label="Choose slide">
    <button role="tab" class="is-active" aria-selected="true" aria-label="Slide 1"></button>
    <button role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-label="Slide 2"></button>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="feature-boxes">
  <div class="container feature-boxes-grid">
    <div class="feature-box">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 21h18M5 21V8l5 3V8l5 3V4h4v17"/><path d="M9 15h2M13 15h2"/></svg>
      <h3>Pharma Manufacturer</h3>
      <p>GMP-compliant manufacturing of tablets, capsules, liquids and more.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-box">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 3h6M10 3v6L4 19a2 2 0 0 0 1.7 3h12.6a2 2 0 0 0 1.7-3L14 9V3"/><path d="M7 15h10"/></svg>
      <h3>Research &amp; Development</h3>
      <p>Our scientists develop safe, effective and stable formulations.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-box">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg>
      <h3>Quality Assurance</h3>
      <p>Every batch is tested thoroughly before it leaves our facility.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-box">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M1 7h13v10H1zM14 10h4l3 3v4h-7z"/><circle cx="5.5" cy="18.5" r="1.5"/><circle cx="17.5" cy="18.5" r="1.5"/></svg>
      <h3>Distribution</h3>
      <p>A wide network of distributors and stockists across the country.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container welcome">
    <div class="welcome-visual" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="welcome-art">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"><path d="M9 2h6v7h7v6h-7v7H9v-7H2V9h7z"/></svg>
      </div>
      <div class="welcome-badge"><strong>{{ "" | year - site.foundedYear }}+</strong><span>Years of<br>Experience</span></div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h2 class="welcome-title">Welcome To <span>{{ site.name }}.</span></h2>
      <p class="welcome-sub">{{ site.tagline }}</p>
      <p class="justify">{{ site.name }} is a pharmaceutical company that develops, manufactures and markets high-quality, affordable medicines. From research to the pharmacy shelf, {{ site.shortName }} makes medicines that meet strict quality standards and stay within patients' reach. Our GMP-compliant facilities and stringent quality control processes ensure that every product meets the standards healthcare professionals expect.</p>
      <a class="btn btn--primary btn--square" href="/about/">About Us <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--alt">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-title">
      <p>Our Product</p>
      <h2>Categories</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-4 category-grid">
      {%- for cat in categories %}{% if loop.index <= 4 %}
      <a class="category-card" href="/products/#{{ cat | slug }}">
        <span class="category-img category-img--{{ loop.index }}" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4"><path d="M10.5 20.5 3.5 13.5a5 5 0 0 1 7-7l7 7a5 5 0 0 1-7 7z"/><path d="m8.5 8.5 7 7"/></svg>
          <span class="category-detail">Detail</span>
        </span>
        <h3>{{ cat }}</h3>
      </a>
      {%- endif %}{% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="center"><a class="btn btn--primary btn--square" href="/products/">More Categories <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section speciality">
  <div class="container speciality-layout">
  <div>
    <div class="section-title section-title--left">
      <p>Why Choose Us</p>
      <h2>What&rsquo;s Our Speciality</h2>
    </div>
    <p class="speciality-intro">At {{ site.name }}, we stand out through our commitment to quality, innovation and customer-centric solutions.</p>
    <div class="speciality-grid">
      <div class="speciality-item">
        <span class="speciality-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M2 21v-1a6 6 0 0 1 6-6h2a6 6 0 0 1 6 6v1"/><path d="M17 11l2 2 4-4"/></svg></span>
        <div><h3>Professional Staff</h3><p>Skilled, experienced and dedicated professionals committed to quality healthcare.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="speciality-item">
        <span class="speciality-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><path d="M3 21h18M5 21V8l5 3V8l5 3V4h4v17"/></svg></span>
        <div><h3>Manufacturing</h3><p>Modern facilities that deliver high-quality formulations at scale.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="speciality-item">
        <span class="speciality-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg></span>
        <div><h3>Quality Assurance</h3><p>Products that meet GMP and industry standards through stringent quality control.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="speciality-item">
        <span class="speciality-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><path d="M9 3h6M10 3v6L4 19a2 2 0 0 0 1.7 3h12.6a2 2 0 0 0 1.7-3L14 9V3"/></svg></span>
        <div><h3>Pharmaceutical Experts</h3><p>R&amp;D and formulation development to create safe and effective products.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
    <div class="speciality-art" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 120 90"><g transform="rotate(-30 60 45)"><rect x="15" y="30" width="90" height="32" rx="16" fill="#fff"/><path d="M60 30h29a16 16 0 0 1 0 32H60z" fill="#d63f19"/></g></svg>
      <span class="speciality-art-label"><strong>{{ site.shortName }}</strong>Quality you can trust</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--alt">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-title">
      <p>Some of our products</p>
      <h2>Latest Products</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-4">
      {%- for product in products %}{% if product.featured %}
      <a class="product-tile" href="/products/#{{ product.category | slug }}">
        <span class="product-thumb">{{ formArt(product.form) }}</span>
        <span class="product-tile-body">
          <h3>{{ product.name }}</h3>
          <span class="product-tile-meta">{{ product.strength }} · {{ product.form }}</span>
        </span>
      </a>
      {%- endif %}{% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="center"><a class="btn btn--primary btn--square" href="/products/">View All Products <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="franchise">
  <div class="container franchise-inner">
    <p class="franchise-kicker">Need a Partner?</p>
    <h2>We welcome distributors and business partners across the country</h2>
    <a class="btn btn--accent btn--square" href="/contact/">Contact Us</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section counters">
  <div class="container counters-grid">
    <div class="counter">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="6"/><path d="M8.5 13.5 7 22l5-3 5 3-1.5-8.5"/></svg>
      <strong data-count="{{ "" | year - site.foundedYear }}">{{ "" | year - site.foundedYear }}+</strong><span>Years of Experience</span>
    </div>
    <div class="counter">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M1 7h13v10H1zM14 10h4l3 3v4h-7z"/><circle cx="5.5" cy="18.5" r="1.5"/><circle cx="17.5" cy="18.5" r="1.5"/></svg>
      <strong data-count="2000">2000+</strong><span>Distributors</span>
    </div>
    <div class="counter">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10.5 20.5 3.5 13.5a5 5 0 0 1 7-7l7 7a5 5 0 0 1-7 7z"/><path d="m8.5 8.5 7 7"/></svg>
      <strong data-count="{{ products.length }}">{{ products.length }}+</strong><span>Products</span>
    </div>
    <div class="counter">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M2 12h20M12 2a15 15 0 0 1 0 20M12 2a15 15 0 0 0 0 20"/></svg>
      <strong data-count="15">15+</strong><span>Countries Served</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="testimonials">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-title section-title--light">
      <p>Testimonials</p>
      <h2>What Our Partners Say</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-3">
      <figure class="testimonial">
        <blockquote>&ldquo;Consistent quality and on-time supply. {{ site.shortName }} has been a reliable partner for our pharmacy chain.&rdquo;</blockquote>
        <figcaption><strong>Rahul M.</strong><span>Distributor</span></figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="testimonial">
        <blockquote>&ldquo;Their team is responsive and knowledgeable. Product documentation is always complete and clear.&rdquo;</blockquote>
        <figcaption><strong>Dr. S. Kapoor</strong><span>Healthcare Professional</span></figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="testimonial">
        <blockquote>&ldquo;A wide range of formulations at fair prices – exactly what our customers need.&rdquo;</blockquote>
        <figcaption><strong>Neha R.</strong><span>Retail Pharmacist</span></figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cert-strip" aria-label="Standards">
  <div class="container cert-strip-inner">
    <span>GMP Compliant</span><span>Quality Tested</span><span>R&amp;D Driven</span><span>Pan-India Distribution</span><span>Export Ready</span>
  </div>
</section>
